Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Conflicts: toybox
Replaces: toybox
Description: toybox multi-call binary (static, single file)
 toybox is a single multi-call binary implementing common Unix utilities.
 .
 This package installs only the statically linked /system/bin/toybox binary.
 It has no runtime dependencies and no applet symlinks; invoke applets as
 "toybox <applet>" (or create the symlinks yourself).
